{"speciesId":158,"names":{"fr":"Kaiminus","es":"Totodile","en":"Totodile","ja":"ワニノコ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Its well-developed jaws are powerful and capable of crushing anything. Even its trainer must be careful."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It is small but rough and tough. It won't hesitate to take a bite out of anything that moves."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"This rough critter chomps at any moving object it sees. Turning your back on it is not recommended."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"Despite the smallness of its body, TOTODILE’s jaws are very powerful. While the POKéMON may think it is just playfully nipping, its bite has enough power to cause serious injury."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"Despite the smallness of its body, TOTODILE’s jaws are very powerful. While the POKéMON may think it is just playfully nipping, its bite has enough power to cause serious injury."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Despite its small body, TOTODILE’s jaws are very powerful. While it may think it is just playfully nipping, its bite has enough strength to cause serious injury."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It is small but rough and tough. It won’t hesitate to take a bite out of anything that moves."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Its well-developed jaws are powerful and capable of crushing anything. Even its TRAINER must be careful."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It has the habit of biting anything with its developed jaws. Even its Trainer needs to be careful."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It has the habit of biting anything with its developed jaws. Even its Trainer needs to be careful."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It has the habit of biting anything with its developed jaws. Even its Trainer needs to be careful."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its powerful, well-developed jaws are capable of crushing anything. Even its Trainer must be careful."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It is small but rough and tough. It won’t hesitate to take a bite out of anything that moves."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il broie tout ce qu’il trouve avec ses mâchoires puissantes. Même son Dresseur doit s’en méfier."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It has the habit of biting anything with its developed jaws. Even its Trainer needs to be careful."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il broie tout ce qu’il trouve avec ses mâchoires puissantes. Même son Dresseur doit s’en méfier."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It has the habit of biting anything with its developed jaws. Even its Trainer needs to be careful."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It has the habit of biting anything with its developed jaws. Even its Trainer needs to be careful."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It has the habit of biting anything with its developed jaws. Even its Trainer needs to be careful."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Petit mais costaud, il n’hésite pas à mordre tout ce qui passe à portée de ses dents."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Es pequeño pero violento. No dudará en morder cualquier cosa que se mueva cerca."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It is small but rough and tough. It won’t hesitate to take a bite out of anything that moves."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"小さいながらも 暴れん坊。 目の前で 動くものが あれば とにかく かみついてくる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Sa mâchoire surdéveloppée est capable de tout broyer. Même son Dresseur doit s’en méfier."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Sus desarrolladas y potentes fauces pueden romper cualquier cosa. Su Entrenador debe tener cuidado."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its powerful, well-developed jaws are capable of crushing anything. Even its Trainer must be careful."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"発達した アゴは パワフルで なんでも かみくだいて しまうので 親のトレーナーでも 要注意。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Malgré son tout petit corps, la mâchoire de Kaiminus est très puissante. Parfois, ce Pokémon mordille les gens pour jouer, sans se rendre compte que sa morsure peut gravement blesser quelqu’un."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Totodile tiene cuerpo pequeño, pero fuertes mandíbulas. A veces, piensa que solo está dando un mordisquito y hace unas heridas bastante considerables."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Despite the smallness of its body, Totodile’s jaws are very powerful. While the Pokémon may think it is just playfully nipping, its bite has enough power to cause serious injury."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"小さな 体でも アゴの 力は 強い。 ワニノコ自身は 甘がみ している つもりでも 大怪我を してしまう ほどの 力が ある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Malgré son tout petit corps, la mâchoire de Kaiminus est très puissante. Parfois, ce Pokémon mordille les gens pour jouer, sans se rendre compte que sa morsure peut gravement blesser quelqu’un."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Totodile tiene cuerpo pequeño, pero fuertes mandíbulas. A veces, piensa que solo está dando un mordisquito y hace unas heridas bastante considerables."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Despite the smallness of its body, Totodile’s jaws are very powerful. While the Pokémon may think it is just playfully nipping, its bite has enough power to cause serious injury."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"小さな 体でも アゴの 力は 強い。 ワニノコ自身は 甘がみ している つもりでも 大怪我を してしまう ほどの 力が ある。"}],"varieties":[{"id":158,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"egg",0],[10,"tutor",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[18